(https://github.com/moode-player/moode), which is licensed under the GNU
General Public License, version 3 or (at your option) any later version. The
line in ytm-art.php, and the lines patch-ytm-art.py writes, become part of
moOde's own PHP files (/var/www/inc/mpd.php, /var/www/inc/music-library.php)
on the radio. These two files are therefore licensed under the same terms:

