The full licence text is in ../../licenses/GPL-3.0.txt (and at the root of
every release tarball, licenses/GPL-3.0.txt).

ytm-art.php is a single PHP line that patch-ytm-art.py copies verbatim into
moOde, so it carries no header of its own; its licence is recorded in
ytm-art.php.license (the REUSE convention for files that cannot hold one).

Other files in this directory (shairport-sync.conf) are ours and MIT
licensed, like the rest of the repository (../../LICENSE).
